{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OUT OF BOUNDS</strong> is a first-person survival sandbox set in the Backrooms. Will you survive long enough to find an exit, or will you perish to the dangers lurking in this never-ending nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/SteamDescHeader_1.png?t=1744313544\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/DescriptionShot1.png?t=1744313544\" />Different levels to explore, with different and unique resources.<br>Every object can be moved around with physics or can be interacted with; If you see it, you can do something with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/SteamDescHeader_2.png?t=1744313544\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/DescriptionShot3.png?t=1744313544\" />Various crafting recipes for you to discover and unlock through a vast tech tree.<br>Bandages, makeshift weapons, electrical and mechanical components and parts. Every recipe has its purpose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/SteamDescHeader_3.png?t=1744313544\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/DescriptionShot2.png?t=1744313544\" />Almost every object can be moved around freely and can be anchored and fixed in place. Make a base to store your resources and keep all your working stations, while you stay safe from any hostile entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/SteamDescHeader_4.png?t=1744313544\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/DescriptionShot4.png?t=1744313544\" />Your ultimate goal is to escape and get back home. With no apparent way of communicating with the outside world, you're stuck alone with your thoughts.<br>Will they get to you, before you can get to the exit?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3089390?t=1744313544","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3089390?t=1744313544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744313544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744313544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OUT OF BOUNDS</strong> is a first-person survival sandbox set in the Backrooms. Will you survive long enough to find an exit, or will you perish to the dangers lurking in this never-ending nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/SteamDescHeader_1.png?t=1744313544\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/DescriptionShot1.png?t=1744313544\" />Different levels to explore, with different and unique resources.<br>Every object can be moved around with physics or can be interacted with; If you see it, you can do something with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/SteamDescHeader_2.png?t=1744313544\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/DescriptionShot3.png?t=1744313544\" />Various crafting recipes for you to discover and unlock through a vast tech tree.<br>Bandages, makeshift weapons, electrical and mechanical components and parts. Every recipe has its purpose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/SteamDescHeader_3.png?t=1744313544\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/DescriptionShot2.png?t=1744313544\" />Almost every object can be moved around freely and can be anchored and fixed in place. Make a base to store your resources and keep all your working stations, while you stay safe from any hostile entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/SteamDescHeader_4.png?t=1744313544\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/extras/DescriptionShot4.png?t=1744313544\" />Your ultimate goal is to escape and get back home. With no apparent way of communicating with the outside world, you're stuck alone with your thoughts.<br>Will they get to you, before you can get to the exit?</p>","developers":["ByteSpace Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089390/header.jpg?t=1744313544","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"OUT OF BOUNDS","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6 GB VRAM or more<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["ByteSpace Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"da